  "basis": "Exact Q218118 mapped square podium way110321832. Native+Z points northeast toward the documented main entrance (the2005 survey and municipal account); native+X follows the facade northwest. The source outline measures about17.4m per side and agrees closely with the published17.20×17.30m podium. Upper round drum radius7.9m is established independently by the measured15.80m diameter in the Istanbul University thesis, rather than taking the ambiguous7.95m tourism value as a diameter. The encircling parapet’s higher infill is on the southwest/south/southeast side, following the published restoration description and municipal exterior photograph.",
